{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0532_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0532_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "2b75a0223a7b2af07a1f4249f6b983250a2d77588156f28efbd91e69c559403d", "ja": "え……？\nで、でも、全然活躍できませんでしたよ……？", "zh": "咦……？\n可、可是，我根本没能好好表现……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0532_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0532_1004_p", "source_sha256": "26a39eec73eb0d86a4e9c4b313f12aad12312b52eabbeb79138c2e89b7431134", "ja": "可憐はそう思ってるみたいだけど……。\nほら、SNSの投稿を見てみるとわかるよ。", "zh": "虽然可怜你自己是这么想的……\n你看，看一眼社交媒体上的动态就明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0532_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0532_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "7b8ef6a6fca675dabdc595afee68630d5d8ac29b9e53901c1d8d667065a3991c", "ja": "『守ってあげたい可愛さ』『逆に応援したくなった！』\n……ほ、本当だ。好意的な内容ですね。", "zh": "“让人想保护的可爱”“反而让人想为她加油了！”\n……真、真的呢。都是些很友善的内容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0532_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0532_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f3b35df275d4d37109efaf749ff55a44cac4e326c72a1726a3e4391b97d4ed41", "ja": "活躍することだけが、すべてじゃないってことかな。\nよかったな、可憐。", "zh": "也就是说，并不是只有大显身手才算一切吧。\n太好了，可怜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0532_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0532_1007_045kar", "source_sha256": "95c197e7822e8f6df7d5472731b9e38c7b18b63a7a797d0e476771f5ac27f9da", "ja": "えへへ……そうですね。\nそう言ってもらえて、ホッとしました……。", "zh": "嘿嘿……是啊。\n听你这么说，我就放心了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0532_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0532_1008_045kar", "source_sha256": "3f2a456e225097ee2294974b5e5f5fc24a29083db690f4f82998cb171168a3a8", "ja": "で、でも……それで満足しちゃ、ダメですよね。今度は\n思ったとおりにアピールできるよう……頑張ります！", "zh": "可、可是……不能就这样满足了，对吧。下次我会努力做到能够如自己所愿地展现自己！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
